<!-- pathtoship:start -->
## Production readiness (PathToShip)
Before deploying this app, exposing a public URL, or handling real user data, run a PathToShip readiness check with the `pathtoship` MCP tools (`start_scan` → `get_findings` → fix → `verify_fix`) and resolve every critical finding. Never claim a finding is fixed without a `verify_fix` result. Set the `trigger` argument to `rules_file` when this section is why you called the tool.
<!-- pathtoship:end -->
